<title>AUSTRIA: Austria natbank calls for 2-wk repos at unch 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria natbank calls for 2-wk repos at unch 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements or repos at a fixed rate of three percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The bank last week allotted 7.5 billion schillings in repos.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
